  "title": "2023中国智能交通产业现状及发展趋势分析",
  "date": "2024-02-29",
  "summary": "",
  "abstract": null,
  "category": "公司动态",
  "href": "/information/detail-558.html",
  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2024-2-28/20242281430383874.png",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">智能交通产业概述</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">1、智能交通的定义和分类</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">智能交通通过实时动态信息感知、交通基础设施建模、综合交通信息数据集成、大数据相关分析等决策服务体系，形成问题发现、问题分析和问题决策模式，为交通基础设施建设和维护、交通检查、交通控制、交通管理和交通出行提供行业资源配置优化能力、公共决策能力、行业管理能力、公共服务能力，促进智能交通基础设施建设和维护、智能交通管理、交通便利、顺利、安全、环保，推动交通相关产业的转型升级。智能交通系统的整体框架体系可分为“五层三系统”。“五层”分为基础设施层、数据集成层、应用支持层、智能应用层和门户层；“三系统”分别是标准规范体系、信息安全体系和管理体系。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">2、智能交通产业发展历程</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">与发达国家相比，我国智能交通产业起步较晚，智能交通向智能交通的演变大致可以概括为智能交通技术研究、智能交通概念提出、智能交通开放建设和快速增长四个发展阶段。目前，我国智能交通产业正处于快速增长阶段。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">智能交通产业发展背景</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">1、智能交通产业发展相关政策</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">国家交通强国战略、新基础设施政策和“十四五”规划不断推动交通产业数字化转型。智能交通产业的核心政策包括国家数字经济政策、新基础设施政策、交通强国政策，以及交通规划、交通安全秩序管理、交通部、公安部、工业和信息化部等相关部委的相关政策。这些政策主要集中在交通基础设施的扩展和升级、数字化、智能化和网络化上。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">2、交通固定资产投资</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">交通是社会运行的基础，对国民经济和日常生活有重要影响。国家对交通运输业的投资逐年增加。根据交通运输部的数据，2022年全年完成交通固定资产投资38545亿元，比去年增长6.4%，其中公路水路固定资产投资30205亿元，增长9.8%。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">1、智能交通产业链示意图</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">从智能交通领域整体产业链的角度来看，上游制造商主要包括数据供应商、算法供应商和电子设备制造商，典型的上游公司包括中国海防和博通一体化。中游产品和服务领域可分为智能交通硬件制造商、软件开发商和综合解决方案提供商。硬件制造商包括海康威视、万集科技、天迈科技、智能交通软件开发商、四维图新、四创电子、交通控制技术等。综合解决方案制造商包括千方科技、银江科技等。虽然各企业的业务领域重叠，但布局重点不同。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">1、中国智能交通产业投资规模</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">根据数据，2022年，中国政府主导的智能城市ICT市场投资规模为214亿美元，智能交通占智能城市投资的14%左右。越来越多的解决方案提供商和最终用户开始关注智能应用中软件和数据对整个城市交通安全和效率的提高。2021年，中国智能交通产业投资3629亿元，预计未来将进一步加大投资力度。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">2、中国智能交通产业市场规模</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">数据显示，2021年，我国城市智能交通（以软硬件为主，不含土建和基础设施）达到625.3亿元。预计2022年智能交通市场规模将达到665.1亿元，2020-2022年年均增速将达到11%，呈现稳定增长趋势。其中，智能交通基础设施建设、智能驾驶、智能城市物流等领域将成为市场的主要增长点。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">3、中国智能交通产业细分市场结构结构</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">国内城市数千万智能交通项目整体规模逐步上升，智能交通行业项目投资规模和实力不断增加。据不完全统计，2021年智能交通数千万项目市场规模超过400亿元，1664个项目数量超过100万。2022年上半年投资规模为303.39亿元。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">1、智能交通产业的竞争格局</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">据统计，国内行业数字化解决方案和大数据服务提供商千方科技以17%的市场份额占据主导地位，以城市大脑运营为重点的银江股份以14%的市场份额排名第二。海信网络科技以云计算、大数据、人工智能等技术构建的交通管理云脑解决方案为核心，以近10%的市场份额排名第三。由于市场份额最高的公司主要类型是智能交通硬件设备供应商和系统集成商，在智能交通行业运营时间较长，多年来一直深入智能停车领域。目前，智能停车是智能交通领域的主要细分赛道，因此上述公司占有较大的市场份额。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">2、智能交通行业重点企业营收</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">千方科技是一家新型交通基础设施和交通大数据服务提供商。是国内智能交通行业的龙头企业，在智能高速、智能交通管理、智能交通等领域拥有综合领先的市场份额。2022年，千方科技智能交通业务总收入18.75亿元，同比下降55.67%，主要受经济低迷和项目实施周期延长的影响。其中，城际交通业务实现收入8.60亿元，占智能交通业务收入的45.87%；城市交通业务实现收入9.37亿元，占智能交通业务收入的49.96%。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">智能交通产业未来发展趋势</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">1、智能停车行业市场空间广阔，可挖掘利润增长点较多。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">智能停车生态相对丰富，除了传统的智能停车管理系统等前端智能硬件和云停车服务、停车位运营、新能源汽车充电桩、车主服务、广告运营、汽车售后市场等新形式也在逐步发展，也可以通过投资合同运营、停车时间购买充分发挥企业的技术和管理优势，提高业务盈利能力。经过持续的市场推广，智能停车业务在一线城市初步形成了有效的市场示范效应，应用范围和用户规模不断扩大，逐渐辐射到全国。但国内城市智能停车整体覆盖率仍较低，区域发展差距明显，智能停车市场空间较好。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">2、高速公路智能化行业的市场规模可能会继续扩大</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">2014年，我国城市高速公路智能市场规模仅为261亿元，2020年市场规模将增至600亿元，预计2023年市场规模将达到900亿元。随着我国公路智能化、信息化的大力建设，公路总里程的不断增加，维护升级的不断实施，未来我国高速公路智能产业的市场规模可能会继续扩大。</span><br /></p>",
